{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"I see what happened here. I understand that tension can get high. I would like to ask everyone DM, mods, and players alike to think about what you're saying, and the remember that things that happen in game are not a tell to how people feel irl. We need open communication, check in with someone before doing something in game that they might not be ok with. We need to build trust between everyone. That includes between players. There is a reason pvp isn't allowed without concent. The same should be true with rp.","created_at":"2020-08-19T18:52:10.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745716760560402542","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
